{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20069","headline":"忆江南弟 · 孟郊","name":"忆江南弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白首眼垂血，望尔唯梦中。\n筋力强起时，魂魄犹在东。\n眼光寄明星，起来东望空。\n望空不见人，江海波无穷。\n衰老无气力，呼叫不成风。\n孑然忆忆言，落地何由通。\n常师共被教，竟作生离翁。\n生离不可诉，上天何曾聪。\n未忍对松栢，自鞭残朽躬。\n自鞭亦何益，知教非所崇。\n努力拄杖来，余活与尔同。\n不然死後耻，遗死亦有终。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20069.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20069","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}